{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|10643D4A498FDCE4EA0CD480C68EF1ED", "source_en": "Yes... Fight me! ", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "أجل... قاتلني!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|166288A34EFD3627F8C1D382B466544E", "source_en": "Shattered Coil or no. War's been the only constant in these long ages past.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "سواءً كان ذلك \"اللفاف السحق\" أم لا، فقد كانت الحرب هي الثابت الوحيد في هذه العصور الطويلة الخالية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|19BA3A174AEAFDC20E8B81A9FFCF70A0", "source_en": "Face me, advocate of man.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "واجهني، يا مدافع البشر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|276F2C1640EAF60090FB098707F3D5E9", "source_en": "Get off your knees welp.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "انهض عن ركبتيك أيها الوَلَف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|28F0AFD341E8E09BEA1FD5AA09D45925", "source_en": "Legend... I think not.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "أسطورة... لا أظن ذلك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|2CA0399F4D4F58A16E05E4BBDBD5600B", "source_en": "Honor my domain, in victory or death!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "أكرم ملكوتي، بالنصر أو بالموت!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|2E897B9C459502F322767C8A67E73CA9", "source_en": "Back into the fight.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "عُد إلى غمار القتال.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|4024900D4E722B609D09B09003ACD67F", "source_en": "Fate's unwitting harbinger. Approaches at last.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "نذير القدر غير المقصود يقترب أخيراً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|5345828640F9DDB51316AE86463B60DD", "source_en": "The advocate of man falls before me.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "يسقط مدافع البشر أمامي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|54A10C294CA5BB62F8DF6F8063B13D44", "source_en": "Haha! Vulnerable once more!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "ها ها! عاجزٌ مرة أخرى!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|6010BF7041C5ED4B8D6A5AB65CFF84BA", "source_en": "A Child of Luderaeon true.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "طفلٌ حقيقي من لوديرايون.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|612375F24D38D5069A2BDDB4DE465783", "source_en": "Pathetic display.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "عرضٌ مثير للشفقة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|6D562BE3428E0C91CA627F8C5BC70038", "source_en": "You are not done, get up.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "لم تنتهِ بعد، انهض.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|72121ECF48F526BDD06BF0842AEA0613", "source_en": "Man nor Angel cannot withstand the tide of war.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "لا إنسانٌ ولا ملاكٌ يقوى على صولة الحرب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|8D9AAE19414416AA147D19959335EC35", "source_en": "You dishonor me with this pathetic display.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "إنك تُهين شرفي بهذا العرض البائس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|A96447604CA1A1528EFB1D8C3EC5EADB", "source_en": "Good, I was afraid that's all you had in you.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "حسنًا، خشيتُ أن يكون هذا كل ما تملك من قوة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|B3224116492AAA158AA27B98D39FF010", "source_en": "Am I outpacing you, Nephilim?!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "أأنا أسبقك بخطواتك، يا نيفيليم؟!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|C1E03ACA4C642BA6F50BDF87B0611242", "source_en": "This was amusing... while it lasted.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "كان الأمر ممتعًا... طالما استمر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|CAE652E84B4DAD68354370970AAE86B0", "source_en": "Like a brilliant flame your fury is gone.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "كشعلةٍ ساطعة، قد خمدت ثورتك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|DB84462D4CB0FD2B8416F79F5465ED26", "source_en": "The glorious blood of the Aeons... magnificent.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "دماء الأجيال المجيدة... يا لها من روعة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|DF49830D40487E6659C5EBBD8BF8486C", "source_en": "The fabled power of the Nephilim! You honor me with this fight!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "قوة النيفيليم الأسطورية! لقد أكرمتني بهذا النزال!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNME_Boss_Mahkteah|E85365ED41505105AF984E8C6CA13C14", "source_en": "Prove your might, fight till your last dying breath!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NME_Boss_Mahkteah", "ar": "أثبت بأسك، وقاتل حتى رمقك الأخير!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
